{'symbol': 'PKG', 'date': '2023-04-24 17:00:00', 'title': 'PACKAGING CORPORATION OF AMERICA REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2023 RESULTS', 'text': 'LAKE FOREST, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PACKAGING CORPORATION OF AMERICA (NYSE: PKG) TODAY REPORTED FIRST QUARTER 2023 NET INCOME OF $190 MILLION, OR $2.11 PER SHARE, AND NET INCOME OF $198 MILLION, OR $2.20 PER SHARE, EXCLUDING SPECIAL ITEMS. FIRST QUARTER NET SALES WERE $2.0 BILLION IN 2023 AND $2.1 BILLION IN 2022. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE ATTRIBUTABLE TO PACKAGING CORPORATION OF AMERICA SHAREHOLDERS \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 THREE MONTHS ENDED \xa0 MARCH 31 \xa0 2023 \xa0 2022 \xa0 CHANGE REPORTED DILUTED EPS $ 2.11 \xa0 $ 2.7.'}